message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper for the release you used
  (see the README's release table) and the software release itself.
title: ML-Spec
type: software
abstract: >-
  Machine learning for extracting molecular electronic couplings from
  two-dimensional electronic spectra (2DES). Versioned public code for the
  Schultz Lab's ML spectroscopy papers.
